# Screen 2 — panel affordances

**PL:** Cztery szmaragdowe przyciski na wspólnej płycie (`#screen2-shared-plate`) — dwa nad treścią (pas górny), dwa pod treścią (pas dolny). Klik otwiera/zamyka panele narożne (ten sam `screen2Toggle` co cytat). Boczne kropki odłożone — zastąpione tymi przyciskami.

**EN:** Four emerald buttons on the common plate (`#screen2-shared-plate`) — two above the content (top band), two below (bottom band). Click toggles the corner panels (same `screen2Toggle` as the quote). Side dots deferred — replaced by these buttons.

## Assets

- `public/cml/btn-emerald.png` / `.webp` — horizontal green stone + gold frame, transparent background (no black plate).

## Reveal pattern (locked — Flat UI successive windows)

When panels appear (quote toggle or emerald buttons), use the **build pattern** from Flat UI community templates — not wallpapers/textures:

- Successive layered panels: opacity + directional `translate` from each corner/side
- Staggered entrance (TL → TR → BL → BR), flat 2D — **no** `translateZ`, canvas `scale(0.88)`, or orbit/perspective
- Keep black glass, center photo + stone, depth wallpaper as they are

## Keep

- Quote marble content stays inside the shared plate; emerald buttons sit on top/bottom bands of that plate (not on quote corners, not over the face photo).
- Panel z-index 50; emerald band z-index 4 on the shared plate.
